      "message": "Update hf_chatbot submodule with multi-config support\n\n- Adds RV32 and RV64 profile support\n- Dynamic config detection and profile selector\n- Updated data structure to data/rv32/ and data/rv64/\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
