  {
    "sha": "1451569aa7d97f738c5ead3124d201c0500bd1c0",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOMngV7toAKDE0NTE1NjlhYTdkOTdmNzM4YzVlYWQzMTI0ZDIwMWMwNTAwYmQxYzA",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Afonso Oliveira",
        "email": "afonso.oliveira707@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-02-02T17:01:31Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Afonso Oliveira",
        "email": "Afonso.Oliveira@synopsys.com",
        "date": "2026-02-02T17:10:16Z"
      },
      "message": "Add Xaifoundry extension definitions for ET-SoC-1\n\nDefine 10 custom RISC-V extensions for the AI Foundry ET-SoC-1 chip:\nXaifoundry (base), Xaifoundryamo (atomic operations), Xaifoundrycache\n(cache management), Xaifoundryfcc (fast credit counter), Xaifoundryflb\n(fast local barrier), Xaifoundryipi (inter-processor interrupt),\nXaifoundrymask (mask operations), Xaifoundrypi (packed integer),\nXaifoundryps (packed single-precision FP), and Xaifoundrytensor\n(tensor operations).\n\nExtension names use lowercase convention (Xaifoundry* instead of\nXAIFoundry*) to comply with case-sensitivity requirements.\n\nSigned-off-by: Afonso Oliveira <afonso.oliveira707@gmail.com>",
      "tree": {
