  {
    "sha": "830149adf48b21eb647a352acfa167907a67dd66",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOMngV7toAKDgzMDE0OWFkZjQ4YjIxZWI2NDdhMzUyYWNmYTE2NzkwN2E2N2RkNjY",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "Afonso Oliveira",
        "email": "afonso.oliveira707@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-02-02T17:01:45Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "Afonso Oliveira",
        "email": "Afonso.Oliveira@synopsys.com",
        "date": "2026-02-02T17:10:16Z"
      },
      "message": "Add corrected CSR definitions for Xaifoundry extensions\n\nDefine 14 CSRs across 5 sub-extensions with addresses and field\nlayouts matching the ET Programmer's Reference Manual:\n\n- Xaifoundry: minstmask (0x7CD), minstmatch (0x7CC),\n  cache_invalidate (0x7D0), excl_mode (0x7D3)\n- Xaifoundrycache: ucache_control (0x800), mcache_control (0x7C0)\n- Xaifoundryfcc: fcc (0x821), fccnb (0xCC0)\n- Xaifoundryps: gsc_progress (0x809)\n- Xaifoundrytensor: tensor_conv_ctrl (0x801), tensor_conv_size (0x802),\n  tensor_coop (0x804), tensor_mask (0x805), tensor_error (0x808)\n\nAll CSRs have detailed per-field definitions with correct bit layouts,\ntypes (RW, RO-H, RW-H), and reset values.\n\nSigned-off-by: Afonso Oliveira <afonso.oliveira707@gmail.com>",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "5117263fafac358f640e5c00f5a623e05071596b",
