      "message": "Add memory-mapped register definitions for Xaifoundry extensions\n\nDefine 39 MMRs across 3 sub-extensions:\n\n- Xaifoundryfcc: 4 credit increment registers (credinc0-3) for\n  inter-hart flow control credit management\n- Xaifoundryflb: 32 fast local barrier registers (0-31) at\n  0x01C0040100 with 8-byte spacing for barrier synchronization\n- Xaifoundryipi: 3 inter-processor interrupt registers (ipi_trigger,\n  ipi_trigger_clear, ipi_redirect_trigger) with 64-bit hart bitmasks\n\nSigned-off-by: Afonso Oliveira <afonso.oliveira707@gmail.com>",
