      "message": "Extract shared HasFields module from CSR and MMR\n\nExtract shared field management into a HasFields module included by both\nCsr and Mmr, eliminating code duplication for field access, wavedrom\nrendering, and config filtering.\n\nChanges:\n- Add HasFields module with shared field management (fields, wavedrom, config filtering)\n- Refactor Csr to use HasFields, removing 11 duplicated methods\n- Refactor Mmr to use HasFields, removing 11 duplicated methods\n- Fix CsrField.dynamic_location? to handle MMR parents via respond_to? guard",
